sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title Feature: Emergency Auto Call & Location
    
    actor Blind User
    participant App as App Logic
    participant GPS as Location Service
    participant Dialer as Phone/GSM
    participant SMS as SMS Service
    actor Contact as Emergency Contact

    Blind User->>App: Shakes Phone (Panic Gesture)
    App->>GPS: Get Current Location
    GPS-->>App: Location (Lat, Long)
    App->>Dialer: Initiate Emergency Call
    Dialer-->>App: Call Connected
    App->>SMS: Send Location SMS
    SMS-->>Contact: "Emergency! Location: [Lat, Long]"
    App-->>Blind User: "Emergency Call & SMS Sent"
